{"title": "Arcane Vehemence", "pageid": 27974, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Arcane_Vehemence", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Arcane Vehemence</b> is a passive feature that restores a spell slot when you land a critical hit.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per <a href=\"/wiki/Short_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short Rest\">Short Rest</a>, you regain a Level 1 <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Slot\">spell slot</a> when you land a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> with the Spellthief. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spellthief\" title=\"Spellthief\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Longbow_PlusOne_Item_Icon.png/30px-Longbow_PlusOne_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Longbow_PlusOne_Item_Icon.png/45px-Longbow_PlusOne_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Longbow_PlusOne_Item_Icon.png/60px-Longbow_PlusOne_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Longbow_PlusOne_Item_Icon.png/30px-Longbow_PlusOne_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Longbow_PlusOne_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Spellthief\" title=\"Spellthief\">Spellthief</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Arcane Vehemence works only during combat. Landing a critical hit outside combat does not restore a spell slot.</li>\n<li>Arcane Vehemence cannot restore <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlock</a> spell slots, even if they are level 1 equivalent slots.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Arcane Vehemence triggers even if the wielder is not missing a Level 1 spell slot (or lacks any Level 1 spell slots to begin with), effectively wasting this passive until the next Short Rest.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202043\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 861/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7353/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2509/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 688957/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.778      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   37.778      1 -total\n 55.06%   20.801      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 44.65%   16.869      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 41.50%   15.678      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 23.99%    9.064      1 Template:Item_icon\n 11.70%    4.421      2 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 10.81%    4.084      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.03%    3.791      1 Template:Hidden_code\n  8.97%    3.388      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n-->\n\n<